{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_80_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_80","textTraditional":"一、十有七年，春，齊人、徐人伐英氏。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_80_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_80","textTraditional":"二、夏，滅項。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_80_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_80","textTraditional":"孰滅之？齊滅之。曷為不言齊滅之？為桓公諱也。春秋為賢者諱。此滅人之國，何賢爾？君子之惡惡也疾始，善善也樂終。桓公嘗有繼絕存亡之功，故君子為之諱也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_80_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_80","textTraditional":"三、秋，夫人姜氏會齊于卞。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_80_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_80","textTraditional":"四、九月，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_80_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_80","textTraditional":"五、十有二月乙亥，齊侯小白卒。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}